.playwright-mcp/

# Scratch files for `git commit -F`. Written here rather than piped because
# PowerShell 5.1's Set-Content emits a BOM, which git then puts in the commit
# subject. One of these was committed by accident in e64b6691 — hence the rule.
.commitmsg.tmp
*.commitmsg.tmp

# Mobile app signing material.
#
# The native projects under mobile/ are committed on purpose — they carry real
# configuration (permissions, icons, associated domains) that has to be
# reviewable. Signing material is the exception, and Capacitor's generated
# mobile/android/.gitignore deliberately leaves these lines commented out, so
# without this a keystore dropped next to the Gradle files is staged by
# default. A committed Android keystore lets anyone sign a build that the Play
# Store accepts as this app, and it is not revocable — Play App Signing pins
# the upload key.
*.jks
*.keystore
mobile/android/keystore.properties
mobile/ios/App/*.mobileprovision
mobile/ios/App/*.p12

# Local artifacts of scripts/migrate-supabase-region.ts. The manifest is a
# point-in-time census of one database (table names, row counts) and the dump
# is the data itself -- neither belongs in git, and the dump least of all.
.migration-manifest.json
*.dump
